      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An update on Project Jigsaw, which aims to modularize the Java SE Platform, the JDK, and applications.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;An update on Project Jigsaw, which aims to modularize the Java SE Platform, the JDK, and applications, so as to reduce download times, improve startup performance, and -- most importantly -- make it easier to construct and maintain large Java programs in a way which integrates well with native packaging systems.&lt;/p&gt;      </description>
